&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Star Trek™ Fleet Command&lt;/strong&gt; team in the UK on a remote basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Star Trek Fleet Command&#39;s ongoing success goes from strength to strength. Our in-house developed 4X MMO was launched in 2018 and continues to evolve, being consistently one of the top grossing Massive Multiplayer Strategy games on the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing, and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Planning and Execution: Collaborate closely with one of our feature teams to shape and refine the development team roadmap, steering vision, and strategy. Oversee the feature lifecycle - from specification writing to launching core features. Manage product requirements and feature quality from inception to delivery, including release analysis and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Player&#39;s Advocate: Prioritize player experience in every decision, aligning development with the target audience&#39;s needs and desires. Understand and address player issues to enhance the game. Identify and implement key initiatives to improve customer and player experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership and Mentorship: Provide leadership in daily tasks and larger projects, ensuring quality and timely execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Analysis and Insights: Manage and analyze game and market metrics, synthesizing data to derive actionable insights and recommendations. Demonstrate sound product judgment to formulate strategies and set clear, measurable objectives for achieving business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication and Collaboration: Serve as a vocal and proactive member of the team, actively communicate complex ideas clearly and maintain visibility with upper management and cross-functional teams to ensure alignment and address potential issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in product management, ideally with significant responsibility on a F2P mobile game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success managing complex monetisation and engagement systems, with extensive experience in content development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-native mindset, with the ability to translate raw performance metrics into strategic insights and actionable plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with a proven track record of aligning diverse teams around a shared product vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong player empathy and experience working with user research, community feedback, or other voice-of-player channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving impact across cross-functional pods, including creative, design, and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we create games for everyone - and want to ensure that the people behind our games reflect that!&amp;nbsp; We are committed to creating a diverse, supportive work environment where everyone is treated with respect. We are committed to providing equal employment opportunities and welcome individuals from all backgrounds to join us &amp;amp; embrace the adventure!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please ensure that the résumé/CV you attach is written in English.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Scopely&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely is a leading video game and global interactive entertainment company, home to many of the world’s most beloved and enduring experiences, including two of the most successful mobile games of all-time “MONOPOLY GO!” and “Pokémon GO,” along with “Stumble Guys,” “Star Trek™ Fleet Command,” “MARVEL Strike Force,” “WWE Champions,” the Scrabble® franchise, “Yahtzee® With Buddies,” and many others. Across mobile, web, PC, and console, Scopely creates, develops, publishes, and live-operates one of the most diversified and award-winning portfolios in the games industry — bringing hundreds of millions of players together through a shared love of play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2011, Scopely is powered by its exceptional team — including thousands of world-class gamemakers around the globe, a distinctive tenet-driven culture, and its proprietary technology platform, Playgami. Together, these strengths have fueled Scopely’s position as the #1 mobile games company in the U.S. and #2 globally, generating more than $10 billion in lifetime revenue. Whether building global sensations like “MONOPOLY GO!” from the ground up, or expanding through strategic acquisitions, including the FoxNext, GSN, and Scopely Explore games businesses — Scopely consistently delivers experiences players love today and return to for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized multiple times as one of the &quot;100 Most Influential Companies in the World&quot; by TIME magazine and one of Fast Company&#39;s &quot;World&#39;s Most Innovative Companies&quot; and “Best Workplaces for Innovators,” Scopely believes that video games can be a force for good — creating meaningful connections, vibrant communities, and making life better through play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely has global operations and partners across four continents in more than a dozen countries worldwide. For more information, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.scopely.com/&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Candidates: Scopely will never request payment or financial information during the application or hiring process. Please apply only through our official &lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt; and verify that all Talent Partner communications come from an email address ending in @&lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;scopely.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you have any questions or encounter any fraudulent requests/emails/websites, please immediately contact ----- Our job applicant privacy policies are available here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-ca-residents&quot;&gt;California Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/eea-and-uk-job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;EEA/UK Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment at Scopely is based solely on a person&#39;s merit and qualifications. Scopely does not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), or any other basis protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 40 years Verifone has&amp;nbsp;established&amp;nbsp;a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide. Verifone has a diverse,&amp;nbsp;dynamic&amp;nbsp;and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and&amp;nbsp;third party&amp;nbsp;partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive for excellence in our products and&amp;nbsp;services, and&amp;nbsp;are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether&amp;nbsp;it’s&amp;nbsp;developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers,&amp;nbsp;partners&amp;nbsp;and investors. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located. Currently, we do allow a hybrid work&amp;nbsp;schedule&amp;nbsp;but we regularly revisit our attendance policy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About The Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product&amp;nbsp;Manager&amp;nbsp;– Hardware.&amp;nbsp;I&lt;/strong&gt;n this role you will&amp;nbsp;be&amp;nbsp;pivotal in translating Verifone’s global hardware strategy into strong regional commercial performance. Sitting at the intersection of Global Hardware Product, Regional Product, Sales, and Customer Success, this role ensures that EMEA markets receive the right solutions, at the right time, with the right positioning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Hardware Strategy &amp;amp; Catalogue&amp;nbsp;Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own&amp;nbsp;and manage the EMEA hardware product catalogue —&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;accuracy across device models, configurations, lifecycle status, and regional availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global ↔ Regional&amp;nbsp;Hardware&amp;nbsp;Liaison&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion&amp;nbsp;EMEA&#39;s voice in global hardware strategy — feeding&amp;nbsp;market&amp;nbsp;insights into the roadmap&amp;nbsp;that reflect field intelligence, customer requirements, and competitive&amp;nbsp;dynamics,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;briefing&amp;nbsp;stakeholders on updates, and sharing pipeline visibility to keep cross-functional teams aligned.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory &amp;amp; Payment-Scheme Compliance:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own EMEA&#39;s&amp;nbsp;regional&amp;nbsp;certification roadmap (PCI PTS, EMVCo,).Pre-Production &amp;amp; Sample Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control and distribute pre-production hardware samples within the region, coordinating with internal teams and external partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage NPI (New Product Introduction) readiness activities within the region — ensuring internal teams are prepared ahead of commercial availability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Control and distribute pre-production hardware samples across the&amp;nbsp;region, and&amp;nbsp;manage NPI&amp;nbsp;(New Product&amp;nbsp;Introduction)&amp;nbsp;readiness to ensure internal teams are prepared ahead of commercial&amp;nbsp;availability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hardware Lifecycle &amp;amp; EOL Management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own EOS/EOL planning for EMEA&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Enablement &amp;amp; Customer Engagement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the EMEA hardware demo/evaluation programme (device&amp;nbsp;configuration, refresh, field enablement), support RFPs with technical positioning, and represent&amp;nbsp;Verifone&amp;nbsp;as the hardware SME in customer QBRs, pilot evaluations, and partner engagements&amp;nbsp;with the credibility of&amp;nbsp;a subject matter expert&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the&amp;nbsp;enablement of ISV&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Acquirer&amp;nbsp;channels&amp;nbsp;and serve as the point of contact for strategic partner reviews and roadmap briefings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Positioning&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain&amp;nbsp;current&amp;nbsp;competitive hardware positioning for Sales and Product&amp;nbsp;teams, and&amp;nbsp;monitor market signals to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;portfolio&amp;nbsp;enhancements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Quality &amp;amp; Reliability&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalation Support&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;KPIs &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;the regional hardware scorecard — catalogue accuracy, certification cycle time, NPI readiness, time-to-market on new SKUs, and field reliability KPIs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a regular hardware operating review to EMEA Product, Sales, and CS leadership; surface risks, dependencies, and decisions needed from the global team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;the EMEA hardware scorecard (certification NPI readiness,), and&amp;nbsp;deliver regular operating reviews to Product&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;&amp;nbsp;Sales&amp;nbsp;leadership.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Required Skills and Experience we desire&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in product management, product marketing, or a related technical role within the payments or fintech industry; Senior PM level or equivalent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;in card-present payment environments — POS hardware, payment terminals, EMV certification,&amp;nbsp;processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct familiarity with payment terminal hardware ecosystems; experience with Verifone or a competing hardware vendor strongly preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage a product catalogue or portfolio across SKU lifecycle, pricing coordination, and regional availability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills — able to drive outcomes across Product, Sales, Operations, Engineering, and CS without direct authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-facing credibility: comfortable presenting hardware roadmaps and product positions to enterprise customers, partners, and senior internal stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written communication skills; able to produce clear regional POVs, competitive briefs, and executive-level summaries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised with the ability to manage multiple concurrent workstreams in a fast-moving, matrixed environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Desirable Skills and Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with Verifone&#39;s hardware portfolio () and software platform (Payment Applications, Gateways).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with&amp;nbsp;certification processes for payment devices, including modem qualification and network sunset planning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in pre-production hardware evaluation, sample management, or New Product Introduction (NPI) processes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting enterprise Sales teams with technical RFP responses, demo programmes, and hardware-level competitive positioning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working within a global product organisation with regional go-to-market responsibilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Android-based payment device platforms, including PSDK, MPoC/SoftPOS, or PCI PTS certification processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Wolt is a Finnish technology company known for its local commerce platform. From food delivery to grocery stores and cosmetics, we make cities better places to live by connecting people with the things they need. Our Global Creative Production team is currently undergoing a massive transformation, shifting from a reactive service center to an &quot;upstream AI-Enabled growth engine&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Creative Producer &lt;/strong&gt;to join us at this pivotal moment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a 6-month fixed contract opportunity starting ASAP.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Helsinki, Berlin, Athens, Stockholm, Copenhagen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Creative Producer, you will manage digital projects from brief to final delivery. You’ll thrive in cross-functional collaboration across different business departments such as B2B, Communication, New Verticals, and Wolt+ teams. You’ll own project timelines for successful deliveries,&amp;nbsp; weekly standups, daily communication with stakeholders and creative teams, and the localization and QA process during the production of social and digital assets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the end-to-end production of digital advertising projects, ensuring our creative assets are not only on-brand but also built for massive scale across global markets. You will be responsible for the day-to-day organization of the team and daily communication from brief to delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role, you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage digital projects and multi-channel campaigns from concept to launch. Our deliverables touch social, in-app, DOOH, event collateral, and OOH.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resource &amp;amp; Budget Control:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee project costs, timelines, and team allocations without losing creative quality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Align internal marketing teams, designers, and external agencies on project milestones and timelines. Daily and/or weekly status updates are crucial for the success of our projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Management &amp;amp; Multitasking&lt;/strong&gt;: Excellent time management skills with the ability to set priorities, multitask, and meet deadlines. Our producers are working on multiple projects simultaneously, and projects might touch different surfaces each time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid Production Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years in creative production or integrated campaign management, ideally within a high-growth tech environment or a progressive digital agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understanding of Media Plans&lt;/strong&gt;: You have experience with specs and asset production across Awareness, Consideration, and Conversion layers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to manage complex projects with multiple high-level stakeholders while maintaining high creative standards. Demonstrated success partnering with distributed teams across time zones and cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;: Ability to assess risks during production, find solutions, and share with management and stakeholders in a timely manner.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational skills&lt;/strong&gt;: Methodical in following a predetermined system to complete tasks and meticulous in paying close attention to small details without losing sight of the big picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong work ethic and accountability&lt;/strong&gt;: A proactive attitude and rigor on everyday tasks, a positive mindset despite ongoing changes, and an excitement to learn. Resourceful during productions; deciding and acting on whether to bring external and/or internal resources and self-motivated to lead the project to completion. Someone who doesn’t shy away from a challenge and follows through on commitments made.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech-Forward Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong interest (and ideally experience) in AI-powered creative tools and generative workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the Future:&lt;/strong&gt; You won’t just be filling a seat; you’ll be building the blueprint for how Wolt produces creative content for years to come.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation at Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Work at the forefront of AI and automation in the creative industry, moving from manual tasks to agentic workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of strategic business priorities and see your work scale globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wolt Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team that values ownership, heart, and a &quot;get things done&quot; attitude in a hybrid, flexible work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Next steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Review:&lt;/strong&gt; Our Production team will review your profile to see if your experience aligns with our strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA Screen:&lt;/strong&gt; A 30-minute introductory call to discuss your background and motivations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; A deep dive into your production philosophy with our Creative Production Lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Loop: Competency &amp;amp; Operating Principles: &lt;/strong&gt;a structured behavioural interview with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
