&lt;li&gt;Prospecter directement les commerçants de votre secteur : restaurateurs, artisans, indépendants et commerces de proximité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprendre leurs besoins et leur présenter les solutions SumUp les plus adaptées&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser des démonstrations claires et convaincantes de nos produits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Négocier et conclure vos ventes directement sur le terrain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer l’intégralité du cycle de vente, du premier contact jusqu’à la signature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer durablement votre secteur grâce à une prospection régulière et structurée&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre vos résultats et ajuster votre approche pour atteindre et dépasser vos objectifs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ce que nous vous proposons&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une formation complète et régulière à nos produits et à nos méthodes de vente&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un accompagnement de proximité pour développer rapidement vos compétences commerciales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une grande autonomie dans l’organisation et le développement de votre secteur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement dynamique, international et orienté vers la performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une opportunité de rejoindre le secteur de la tech et de la fintech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des perspectives d’évolution vers des fonctions commerciales seniors ou d’encadrement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Ce poste est fait pour vous si&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez déjà une expérience concrète de la&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;prospection à froid&lt;/strong&gt;, idéalement sur le terrain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes à l’aise pour aborder des prospects qui ne connaissent pas encore SumUp et susciter leur intérêt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous aimez la vente terrain, la prospection directe et le contact humain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous savez créer rapidement une relation de confiance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous faites preuve d’aisance orale, d’énergie et de force de conviction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous savez rebondir face aux objections et rester motivé(e) dans un environnement exigeant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes autonome, organisé(e), persévérant(e) et orienté(e) vers les résultats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous aimez les objectifs ambitieux et souhaitez avoir un impact direct sur votre rémunération&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous parlez couramment français et disposez d’un niveau d’anglais vous permettant de participer à des échanges internes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience préalable en prospection à froid est indispensable pour réussir dans ce poste.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Vos avantages&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En complément de votre rémunération, vous bénéficiez notamment de :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;25 jours de congés payés&lt;/strong&gt;, auxquels s’ajoutent les jours fériés et des jours de congé spéciaux offerts par SumUp (anniversaire, déménagement...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Break4Me : un mois de congé sabbatique entièrement rémunéré après trois ans d’ancienneté&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Titres-restaurant de 12 € par jour travaillé&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une solution de mobilité adaptée à votre situation :&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;allocation mobilité/véhicule de 400 € via Betterway accompagnée d’une carte de frais professionnels&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;remboursement à 100 % de votre abonnement aux transports publics&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;ou&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;budget de mobilité douce de 600 € par an&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indemnité téléphonique de 30 €&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indemnité Internet de 36 €&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mutuelle d’entreprise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accès à&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Wellpass&lt;/strong&gt;, avec une participation de SumUp, pour vos activités sportives et de bien-être&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accès à notre plateforme CE d’avantages salariés&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultations médicales à distance gratuites avec&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Livi&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accès aux services de&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;La Maison Bleue&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagnement proposé par&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Action Logement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Programme de recommandation interne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des opportunités régulières de formation, d’apprentissage et de développement professionnel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Processus de recrutement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Échange avec un recruteur&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Discussion sur votre parcours et vos motivations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien avec le manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Approfondissement de vos compétences et de votre compréhension du rôle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mise en situation commerciale&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;– Exercice pratique permettant d’évaluer votre approche de la vente terrain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;À propos de SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez SumUp, nous soutenons les commerçants du quotidien : artisans, restaurateurs, indépendants et commerces de proximité. Nos solutions leur permettent d’accepter facilement les paiements, de gérer leur activité et de se concentrer sur ce qu’ils font de mieux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plus de 3 000 collaborateurs issus de 93 nationalités contribuent aujourd’hui à cette mission. Guidés par nos valeurs —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Founder’s Mentality, Team First et We Care&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— nous travaillons ensemble pour simplifier le quotidien des petites entreprises.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp est un employeur garantissant l’égalité des chances. Nous valorisons la diversité des parcours, des expériences et des profils.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Un dernier conseil&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous avez une expérience en prospection à froid, mais ne cochez pas tous les autres critères ? Postulez quand même.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre potentiel, votre motivation, votre capacité à apprendre et votre envie de réussir peuvent faire toute la différence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prêt(e) à transformer chaque rencontre en opportunité et à développer votre secteur avec SumUp ? Postulez dès maintenant et venez construire la suite de votre réussite commerciale avec nous.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Are We?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP&lt;/strong&gt; is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build a better future for our people, planet, clients, and communities. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt; is WPP’s global media collective. In a media-rich world, we bring together the best platform, the best talent, and the best partners to develop the most innovative solutions, delivering unparalleled growth for our clients. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It is through this synergy that we create truly exceptional experiences, both for our clients and for our internal teams. To succeed in this role, it is fundamental to embody the core values that unite WPP and WPP Media:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; Fostering collective leadership that inspires truly transformational creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create an Open Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Striking the perfect balance between employee fulfillment and client satisfaction, all built on mutual trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Optimism:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively driving growth and development to energize our entire organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Missions &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Data &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director&lt;/strong&gt; enforces global data standards, taxonomy integrity, and compliance across all luxury Maisons and markets. He/She is responsible for transitioning data operations from manual checks to an automated &lt;strong&gt;Prevention–Monitoring–Correction&lt;/strong&gt; framework. The rôle ensure strong data quality for global reporting, Optimus dashboards, and ultimately WPP Open integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Data Governance Director&lt;/strong&gt;, you will enforce global data standards, taxonomy integrity, and compliance across all luxury Maisons and markets. You will be responsible for transitioning data operations from manual checks to an automated &lt;strong&gt;Prevention–Monitoring–Correction&lt;/strong&gt; framework. This role ensures strong data quality for global reporting, Optimus dashboards, and ultimately WPP Open integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Data Governance &amp;amp; Taxonomy Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Framework &amp;amp; Model Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, own, and execute the end-to-end Prevention–Monitoring–Correction data model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Taxonomy Review:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the yearly cycle for global taxonomy review, cleanup, and integration of new data dimensions across all Maisons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Naming Conventions:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce standardized naming conventions globally, including unique Campaign IDs to enable automated campaign record aggregation via Accutics or internal systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AdTech &amp;amp; Tracking Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee tracking standards across server-side tagging, GA4, channel grouping governance, and migration projects (e.g., BBB – ARM Migration).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Operations &amp;amp; Compliance Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Accuracy Enforcer:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive global data compliance from current baselines up to a strict 95% accuracy rate across all channels, Maisons, and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Input Data Readiness:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure clean, trusted input data flows into Optimus dashboards (and ultimately WPP Open), eliminating fragmented taxonomies and reporting discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team &amp;amp; Process Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct and advise Data Operations Executives and Associate Directors on best practices for automated data validation beyond basic string checking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 8–10+ years of proven experience in Digital Data Governance, Taxonomy Management, or Media Data Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong AdOps background with hands-on experience in digital tracking, ad serving, and multi-market data compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of taxonomy architecture, dynamic UTM/naming structures, Accutics, Google Analytics 4 (GA4), server-side tracking, and campaign management workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of enforcing governance standards across multi-brand, multi-agency, and international team environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Great autonomy, strong organizational skills, and a strategic mindset. High level of diplomacy, active listening, and the ability to communicate technical data governance standards clearly to both executive stakeholders and operational teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to shaping the future of media is reflected in active support for the professional development of our talent, helping them reach their full potential. This approach goes hand-in-hand with a responsible vision in our media investment strategies, reflecting our dual priority: valuing our people while adopting sustainable practices across our industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media employees have privileged access to WPP Media and WPP global networks, enabling them to expand their professional network and stay at the forefront of marketing and advertising innovation. We foster an inclusive work culture where team accomplishments and expertise are regularly celebrated through engaging internal events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits Include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working Model:&lt;/strong&gt; Up to 2 work-from-home days per week, plus 2 full weeks of remote work per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Time Off:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 extra days off offered annually, plus additional leave tiers based on seniority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusive Policies &amp;amp; Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Dedicated health leave programs (including up to 5 WFH days/month for employees suffering from endometriosis), specific support programs, and paid leave allowances for employees with recognized disability status (RQTH).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Opportunities to participate in community and solidarity missions via our &lt;em&gt;&quot;We care and we act&quot;&lt;/em&gt; program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; An initial phone or video interview with a member of our Talent Acquisition team to discuss your experience, expectations, and answer your questions about the role and company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Interview:&lt;/strong&gt; An in-depth interview with key operational leadership to evaluate your technical background, leadership style, and cultural fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Case Study / Technical Assessment:&lt;/strong&gt; A case study presentation to demonstrate your practical skills in data governance architecture, taxonomy framework design, and stakeholder management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to making this process as fast, transparent, and collaborative as possible.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;WPP Media guarantees equal opportunity and considers all applicants without discrimination. We are committed to cultivating a respectful environment where everyone belongs and has equal access to professional growth.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does an UK- New Business Director&amp;nbsp;do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The New Business Director plays a pivotal role in shaping and driving growth for WPP Production, &lt;strong&gt;defining how we win high-value, complex opportunities and shaping the strategic direction of our UK growth function&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the strategic direction and narrative for priority new business opportunities, &lt;strong&gt;designing integrated solutions and clear go-to-market propositions.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;You will ensure that every response (whether formal RFP or informal approach) is clearly positioned, commercially compelling and aligned to client needs. You will be accountable for the &lt;strong&gt;quality and consistency of our narrative and strategic output across all UK pitches&lt;/strong&gt;, setting the standard for how we articulate our value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with senior stakeholders across WPP Production and the wider WPP network, you will play a key role in &lt;strong&gt;driving integration across Media, Creative and Production&lt;/strong&gt;, shaping how we bring together capabilities to deliver differentiated client solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond individual opportunities, you will take a broader view of growth — &lt;strong&gt;defining where we should focus, how we prioritise opportunities, and how we scale success globally&lt;/strong&gt;. This includes evolving our approach to pitches, refining commercial models and embedding best practice ways of working across the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role with visibility across the whole UK business, suited to someone who thrives in the fast-paced world of new business, operates with a high level of autonomy, and is motivated by driving measurable growth and business impact at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key areas of responsibility:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and lead the strategic direction for priority, high-value opportunities, ensuring a clear and differentiated approach to winning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accountable for the narrative quality and strategic standard across all pitches, setting the benchmark for how we articulate our value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end client solutions and commercial models, including operating models, pricing approach and value proposition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of go-to-market propositions, continuously evolving how WPP Production positions itself in market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Global Chief Growth Officer to define and drive the global growth strategy for WPP Production, identifying priority markets, opportunity types and areas of focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and influence where we focus our growth efforts, ensuring time and resource are prioritised on the highest value opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse pipeline, performance and market trends to identify where growth is coming from — and where it should come from next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leadership to shape growth priorities, targets and investment decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improved conversion, efficiency and revenue impact across the new business pipeline through stronger strategic positioning and approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and scale a repeatable growth engine, embedding frameworks, playbooks, tools and best practice that enable teams globally to win consistently without central dependency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a “pitch doctor”, stepping into critical opportunities to strengthen narrative, structure and overall response quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and represent WPP Production in senior client meetings &amp;amp; pitch meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive cross-WPP integration, ensuring seamless collaboration across Media, Creative and Production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and embed new ways of working, improving how we approach, structure and deliver pitches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead on innovation in growth, including exploring the use of AI and new technologies to enhance team capability and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain strong relationships with senior stakeholders across WPP and key client organisations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and scale team capability, through coaching, mentoring and training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;What good looks like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in new business, client leadership, growth or strategy roles within a creative, production or agency environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional strategic thinking, with a proven ability to define how complex opportunities are approached and won&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding writing and storytelling ability, with experience leading narrative development for high-value, multi-disciplinary pitches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen, with experience designing and influencing commercial models, pricing strategies and value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to use and apply AI tools to the new business process&lt;/li&gt;
